# .gitignore.example — sample ignore rules for the local_documentation workspace
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to .gitignore to activate:   cp .gitignore.example .gitignore
#
# Policy:
#   TRACK    everything that defines the agent / skills / AI assistance:
#            .claude/ (agents, skills, knowledge bases), AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md,
#            GEMINI.md, README.md, templates/, mcp_config.json, git_mcp_server.py
#   IGNORE   the working output: authored technical documentation and any
#            scratch/working folders created while doing the work.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Working folders (documentation work — NOT committed) ------------------
# Project documents under observation and their drafts are working artifacts.
docs/
drafts/

# Any other scratch/working directories created during work.
scratch/
tmp/
tmp_*/
out/
export/
_work/
*.draft.md

# --- Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit) ----------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.local.env
*.token
*.secret
secrets/
credentials.json

# --- Local, per-user tool settings -----------------------------------------
# Keep shared .claude/ (agents, skills, KB) tracked; ignore only local overrides.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Python / tooling caches (git_mcp_server.py etc.) ----------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicitly KEPT tracked (documented for clarity — no rule needed):
#   .claude/agents/**        AI subagents
#   .claude/skills/**        skills + code-recon/knowledge/** knowledge bases
#   templates/**             cross-project documentation template (tooling asset)
#   AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md GEMINI.md README.md
#   mcp_config.json git_mcp_server.py
#   .gitignore.example
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
